Portsire for Mapper Ireland
===========================
(In NOTEPAD use EDIT-WORDWRAP)

About Mapper Ireland
====================
Mapper Ireland is a Geographical Information System programme for the PSION3a palmtop computer.  It displays outline maps of Great Britian and selectively overlays road, ferry and airport information as well as a range of useful data for leisure and business activity.  Also available is Mapper for Ireland and for London in large scale.  Created by and copyright 1994, 1995 to Steve Litchfield.  Steve Litchfield runs 3-Lib a library of shareware and utility programmes for Psion pocket computers.  Steve can be contacted at:

